<rml>
<head>
    <title>touch_close</title>
    <!--
        The phone's way out of a screen (14-10): one round button over whatever screen is up -- the inventory, the
        PDA, trade, a body, a talk, a script's window. xrGame/ui_rml_touch.cpp shows it, sizes it by the panel's
        dpi (the screens' own unit is no thumb's: it follows the layout), and a tap on it is the pad's Plus -- Esc
        over a screen, so each screen closes by its own rules.
    -->
    <style>
        body
        {
            display: block;
            position: absolute;
            right: 1%;
            top: 1%;
            text-align: center;
            font-family: rml_roboto;
            color: #d6c7a1;
            background-color: rgba(18, 18, 16, 170);
            border: 2px rgba(214, 199, 161, 170);
        }
        body:active { background-color: rgba(214, 199, 161, 130); color: #1a1a16; }
    </style>
</head>
<body id="t-close">×</body>
</rml>
